# A Warband game, written down move by move.
#
# Lines that are not comments are commands, exactly as they are typed at the
# prompt. Undo and redo are moves like any other, so reading this file back
# retraces the game as it was really played - second thoughts and all - and
# arrives at the same position it was saved from.
#
# The deal line says how many were playing, what they were dealt from, and who
# was in each seat - 'you' for a person here, a skill for the program. The format
# line above it is the shape of the file itself, so a later engine reading this
# one knows what it is looking at.
#
#   Warband replay <this file>

format 1
deal 2 639231281371667662 you steady

#   1  turn 0, Squad One
engage 3
#      The lines are drawn up 3 hexes apart.

#   2  turn 1, Squad One
muster rider f2
#      Squad One musters a rider at f2.

#   3  turn 2, Squad Two
muster warder f2
#      Squad Two musters a warder at f2.

#   4  turn 3, Squad One
muster footman f1
#      Squad One musters a footman at f1.

#   5  turn 4, Squad Two
muster rider f1
#      Squad Two musters a rider at f1.

#   6  turn 5, Squad One
muster spearman m2
#      Squad One musters a spearman at m2.

#   7  turn 6, Squad Two
muster spearman m3
#      Squad Two musters a spearman at m3.

#   8  turn 7, Squad One
muster bowman b2
#      Squad One musters a bowman at b2.

#   9  turn 8, Squad Two
muster bowman b2
#      Squad Two musters a bowman at b2.

#  10  turn 9, Squad One
muster bowman b3
#      Squad One musters a bowman at b3.

#  11  turn 10, Squad Two
muster bowman b3
#      Squad Two musters a bowman at b3.
#      Both squads are mustered. The battle begins, and nobody is asked anything more.

#  12  turn 11, Squad One
stop
#      The battle is stopped. 'step' takes it a blow at a time.

#  13  turn 12, Squad One
step
#      Round 1.
#      Squad One's bowman at b2 shoots Squad Two's bowman at b2 for 2, and leaves it 5.
#      Squad One's bowman at b2 shoots Squad Two's bowman at b2 for 2, and leaves it 3.
#      Squad One's bowman at b2 shoots Squad Two's bowman at b2 for 2, and leaves it 1.

#  14  turn 13, Squad One
step
#      Squad One's bowman at b3 shoots Squad Two's bowman at b2 for 2, and leaves it nothing.
#      Squad Two's bowman at b2 falls.
#      Squad One's bowman at b3 shoots Squad Two's bowman at b3 for 2, and leaves it 5.
#      Squad One's bowman at b3 shoots Squad Two's bowman at b3 for 2, and leaves it 3.

#  15  turn 14, Squad One
step
#      Squad Two's bowman at b3 shoots Squad One's bowman at b2 for 2, and leaves it 5.
#      Squad Two's bowman at b3 shoots Squad One's bowman at b2 for 2, and leaves it 3.
#      Squad Two's bowman at b3 shoots Squad One's bowman at b2 for 2, and leaves it 1.

